       												<h4>ANIRUDH DAR <span>- Founder</span></h4>
       												<p>Anirudh has had over nineteen years' experience, first in the hospitality sector in which he holds an MBA degree from France and later in banking and financial advisory. Truuegro is his entrepreneurial effort. The company he formed is designed to literally bridge the gap between financial aspirations people have and the ground reality of markets. Under his personal tutelage Truuegro provides professional expertise and helps open doors to several modern avenues for investment by fully analysing market conditions and offering an objective view on the investment climate. Anirudh enjoys meeting people. Perhaps, this more than anything else, underscores his deep commitment to his job - and his company.</p>
       												<p>Anirudh has worked with global banks such as Deutsche Bank and ABN Amro Bank in personal and private banking roles and with Ameriprise Financial initially as part founding team helping it make its India foray, and later in a leadership role  - until the they shut their India operations in 2014. When not juggling numbers, Anirudh is an avid runner, unwinds by listening to music and following the fortunes of Manchester United.</p>
